      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vertex as the external provider. Now, my focus is on how to integrate a provider-managed model into the Python file, `invoke_platform_model.py`. The key will be to make the provider easily identifiable within the code.\n\n\n**Constructing the Invocation**\n\nI'm now writing the Python code for `invoke_platform_model.py`. I've imported `google.cloud.aiplatform`. The function structure is set: project, location, and model IDs are inputs. I'm focusing on initializing the Vertex AI client within the function. Next, I will add placeholders to manage inputs and outputs as I don't know the exact format yet. The goal is to provide a clean and identifiable structure.\n\n\n",
